Open terminal in Kali Linux
python3 -m http.server 8080
Open another terminal → sudo tcpdump -i any -w capture.pcap port 8080
Open Firefox → go to http://localhost:8080 → refresh multiple times
Press Ctrl+C in tcpdump terminal to stop capture
Open File Manager → find capture.pcap in home folder → double-click to open in Wireshark
Filter for POST requests: http.request.method == "POST" → press Enter
Click any packet → expand protocol sections → view browser, OS, URL details
